30,2,1,talk,May,,"Most complaints come from the person right next to the bins. Also, some of our frontages are way too narrow for a bay.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The bin house at the station block smells terrible in summer. Also, supervising the mornings takes nearly an hour each time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"We're spending thousands on nets and deodorants already! And a new shelter is expensive, even with the ward subsidy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Midori,,"People aren't willing to police their neighbors' bags. Plus, the station block started fighting over who sweeps the bin house.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The truck arrives very early, which is a tight window. Also, the paperwork for a permanent build is quite tedious.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, an hour of supervising sounds like a lot of work for one person.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, it is. And if the bin house smells worse than the open pile, that's a huge problem for whoever lives nearby.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, if the paperwork is that bad, maybe we shouldn't do a permanent build?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, I agree. If it leads to arguments over cleaning, it might ruin our neighborhood harmony.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the early arrival of the truck means some of us would have to be awake and working very early.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, we also have to think about the cost. If it's expensive and the space is narrow, it's not fair.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, if people won't even police bags, a supervised window might just cause more fights.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm worried about the budget. We're already losing money on the current mess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Midori,,I just want us to stay on good terms. A permanent structure sounds like a recipe for more conflict.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Servas,,The administrative burden of changing sites frequently also seems quite high according to the clerk.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
