55,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A is rotating, B is managed hours, and C is an enclosure. I'm leaning toward A to share the burden.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm against C because of the smell and the fighting. B seems too stressful with the early truck.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"C is too expensive for some of us. A seems the most budget-friendly, but Servas mentioned the paperwork.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I don't like B because people won't police each other. A seems fairer, as long as we can agree.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Servas,,A requires a new notice every time we move. B is a heavy time commitment. C is a bureaucratic nightmare.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, is the notice for A really that bad? It's better than one person suffering for years.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, but some frontages are too narrow. We can't just put the bins anywhere.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, maybe we can just adjust the position slightly on the narrow spots?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that sounds like a good compromise to keep the peace.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a hassle, but perhaps a shared hassle is better than a permanent resentment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,May,,I'm voting for A. It's the only way to be truly equal.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll vote for A too. It's better than a smelly box or an early morning shift.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote A. It keeps the costs low for everyone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll go with A. It's the most balanced for our relationships.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I shall also vote for A. It is the most equitable path, despite the paperwork.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
